---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Elder Pickle handles accounts, comments, and email."
>
  <h1 class="hero-title">Privacy</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Elder Pickle uses <strong>Clerk</strong> for authentication. When you create an
      account or sign in, Clerk processes identity data such as your email address
      and profile details according to Clerk’s policies.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you leave a comment, we store the comment body, your display name, your
      Clerk user id, the post slug, timestamps, and moderation status in
      <strong>Convex</strong>. Comments are public by default unless soft-hidden by
      the site owner.
    </p>
    <p>
      When a new comment is posted, Elder Pickle may send a transactional email
      notification to the site owner only. We do not send comment notification
      emails to other readers or build a marketing list from comments.
    </p>
    <p>
      Soft-hidden comments are retained for moderation and are not shown on the
      public post. To request deletion of your account-linked comments, contact
      the site owner using the email address associated with this domain.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
